res, and temperatures.\", \"fields_meaning\": {\"coolant\": {\"level_percent\": \"A DECIMAL(5,2) for the coolant level percentage in the system.\", \"pressure_kpa\": \"An INT for the coolant pressure in kilopascals.\", \"temperature_c\": \"A REAL number denoting the coolant temperature in Celsius.\"}, \"fuel\": {\"consumption_lh\": \"A DECIMAL(5,2) representing fuel consumption in liters per hour.\", \"level_percent\": \"A REAL value specifying the current fuel tank level percentage.\", \"pressure_kpa\": \"A SMALLINT measuring the fuel pressure in kilopascals.\", \"temperature_c\": \"A FLOAT for the current fuel temperature in Celsius.\"}, \"hydraulic\": {\"level_percent\": \"A DECIMAL(5,2) indicating the hydraulic fluid level as a percentage.\", \"pressure_kpa\": \"A DECIMAL(7,3) specifying the hydraulic system pressure in kilopascals.\", \"temperature_c\": \"A FLOAT for the hydraulic fluid temperature in Celsius.\"}, \"oil\": {\"level_percent\": \"A REAL value for the oil level percentage.\", \"pressure_kpa\": \"An INT indicating the oil pressure in kilopascals.\", \"temperature_c\": \"A DOUBLE PRECISION value measuring the engine oil temperature in Celsius.\"}}} JSONB column. Groups fluid-related metrics for fuel, oil, coolant, and hydraulic systems, including levels, pressures, and temperatures. JSONB"};
